565d","bytes":692,"dropped_lines":0,"n_chunks":2,"citation_sha256":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","reused":false},"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_20261125/evidence/mm1_local_position_probe_excerpt_20261125.txt":{"indexed":true,"sha256":"2d1e8eb38c77cdb640597d42957cbeb38262e32afb17c16ae7031b38f37ad2f8","bytes":1302,"dropped_lines":0,"n_chunks":2,"citation_sha256":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","reused":false}},"chunks":[{"chunk_id":"b1ea3cbd31fb","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_20261125/evidence/mm1_coordinate_facts_20261125.txt","source_id":"tasvideos_mm1_object_ram_table","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-23","element_types":["帧数据","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":25,"text":"TASVideos GameResources：洛克人1坐标系统（逐字摘录）\nCoordinate system\nIn Rockman and Rockman 2, every object of the game has the following properties:\nScreen number (00―FF), it tells which screen the object resides in.\nX position (00.00―FF.FF), it tells where in the screen the object is in.\nY position (00.00―FF.FF), it tells where in the screen the object is in.\nX speed (−80.00―7F.FF).\nY speed (−80.00―7F.FF).\nThe position of the object has 8 bits of decimal part,\nbut only the integer part can be observed on the screen.\nY coordinates increase towards the bottom of the screen\nX coordinates increase towards the right\nNegative Y speed means falling, positive Y speed means ascending\nX speed is always positive. It is subtracted or added depending on Rockman’s facing.","text_sha":"cdd73acb482ce617dbb086e6f1dcccdc4fde3785","dl":138},{"chunk_id":"91b55bcd7e14","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_20261125/evidence/mm1_object_ram_table_20261125.txt","source_id":"tasvideos_mm1_object_ram_table","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-23","element_types":["帧数据","基础档案"],"kind":"table","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":17,"text":"TASVideos GameResources：洛克人1对象 RAM 表（逐字摘录）\nGame Screen# X (hi,lo) Xspd (hi,lo) Y (hi,lo) Yspd (hi,lo)\nRockman 1 $460 $480:$4A0 $4C0:$4E0 $600:$620 $660:$680\nRockman 2 $440 $460:$480 $600:$620 $4A0:$4C0 $640:$660\nRockman 3 $380 $360:$340 no RAM address? $3C0:$3A0 $460:$440\nRockman 4 $348 $330:$318 no RAM address? $378:$360 $3F0:$3D8\nRockman 5\nRockman 6\nThe variables for object # n can be found by adding n to each address.\nBoss has n =1 in RM1/2, Rockman always has n =0.","text_sha":"a3a274f12c3dabc52020b343bd2efc590cafa54c","dl":130},{"chunk_id":"b8e620db8b4c","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_20261125/evidence/mm1_bizhawk_memory_write_fact_20261125.txt","source_id":"tasvideos_bizhawk_faq_write_refresh","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-23","element_types":["基础档案","帧数据"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":10,"text":"TASVideos BizHawk FAQ：内存覆盖与 memory write callback（逐字摘录）\nMemory Manipulation\nI'm trying to cheat/poke/freeze a memory address, but it keeps changing\nBizhawk can only overwrite your address once per frame, so if the game changes it more frequently, you'll have to use memory write callbacks to track when the game does so, to overwrite it yourself right after that.\nBut since some callbacks happen before the event, and some happen after (depending on the core), you may have to change CPU registers instead, where the value initially comes from upon the memory write.\nNote that not every Bizhawk core implements memory callbacks and register editing.","text_sha":"beec6d9930fd83144c2c1761343ff9207c0b60d5","dl":113},{"chunk_id":"c61b630a747d","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_20261125/evidence/mm1_fm2_import_reference_fact_20261125.txt","source_id":"tasvideos_forum_19912_fm2_import","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"reference_only","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-23","element_types":["基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":18,"text":"TASVideos Forum 19912：FM2 导入 BizHawk（参考性社区流程，逐字摘录）\nLocation: The land down under.\nUseless topic is useless.\nIf your file is in the fm3 format (TAS Editor)\nFile > Export to FM2\n(You know the thing you should do before submitting, instead of submitting an evil fm3 file, which is possible.)\nNow within BizHawk.","text_sha":"863b31f0952991b84cea8a3ea5e4ad34b575dabe","dl":62},{"chunk_id":"89d9b41930f5","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_20261125/evidence/mm1_segmented_tas_reference_fact_20261125.txt","source_id":"tasvideos_glossary_segmented","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"reference_only","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-23","element_types":["基础档案","说明书"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":8,"text":"TASVideos Glossary：segmented movie 通用术语（参考性，逐字摘录）\nSegmented, Multi-segment\nMade in parts.\nA segmented movie consists of individual levels or sections of a game which each are played separately.\nMaking of segmented movies can be seen as a limited form of re-recording: instead of saving/loading at any point at will, saving/loading is only done at segment borders.","text_sha":"984ad5a966813b3e0defd7ad4f7e821a9a49269a","dl":66},{"chunk_id":"7f5c0a4bd262","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_20261125/evidence/mm1_local_weapon_ram_excerpt_20261125.txt","source_id":"local_mm1_taspipe_measurements","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["帧数据","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"本机实测：洛克人1武器 RAM 地址与值表（隔离候选摘录）","lang":"zh","line_start":2,"line_end":2,"text":"来源：测试问题与闸门说明书.md 第712-716行；逐字摘录，不含撤回段。","text_sha":"190f40573e0c54836882be06470628bb460d9cba","dl":25},{"chunk_id":"0d852bfc5b79","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_20261125/evidence/mm1_local_weapon_ram_excerpt_20261125.txt","source_id":"local_mm1_taspipe_measurements","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["帧数据","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"33.1 owned/current 地址实证与三条撤回","lang":"zh","line_start":4,"line_end":7,"text":"- **owned=0x5D 位场**（bit=菜单行：1B 2E 3G 4I 5C 6F 7M，bit0=P 不画行）；写 0xFF 菜单出全 7 行、\n写 0x40 只出 F 行（`ramdiff/w/bit_40/f0029.png` 亲看）。文献\"0x5D=all_stages_complete\"单一语义撤回。\n- **current_weapon=0x5F**，值表 0P 1C 2I 3B 4F 5E 6G 7M：菜单逐行装备 + `attempt(ram=)` 冻结差分\n（`ramdiff/e/equip_table.json`），装色亲看互证（Bomb 绿 / Elec 奶油 / Fire 红 / Ice 淡紫）。","text_sha":"91abddc9bde17dafe93d75ca5476dccedbdc4f09","dl":96},{"chunk_id":"ba41dfe550d3","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_20261125/evidence/mm1_local_position_probe_excerpt_20261125.txt","source_id":"local_mm1_taspipe_measurements","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["帧数据","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"本机实测：洛克人1对象表定位 T1 五臂试验（隔离候选摘录）","lang":"zh","line_start":2,"line_end":2,"text":"来源：场景取得方法_调研与设计_2026-11-23.md 第44-58行；逐字摘录。","text_sha":"cf181aee4b67ec99862f80bba41f7738a7beb5fb","dl":25},{"chunk_id":"3885c96f461e","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_20261125/evidence/mm1_local_position_probe_excerpt_20261125.txt","source_id":"local_mm1_taspipe_measurements","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["帧数据","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"3. T1 实测：权威表 vs 派生副本（全部臂等长 = 4 空帧，同一个 root `cut_spawn.state`）","lang":"zh","line_start":5,"line_end":17,"text":"| 臂 | 补丁 | 读回 `$0022` / `$0025` | 相机 `$001A/$001B` | 与基线像素差 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `ctl_none` | 无 | 128 / 148 | 0 / 0 | 0（恒量基线） |\n| `derived_ctl` | `$0022=200` | **128** / 148 | 0 / 0 | **0** |\n| `x_only` | `$0480=176` | **168** / 148 | **40** / 0 | **20,042（34.95%）** |\n| `scr12` | `$0460=12` | 232 / 148 | 0 / **3** | 566 |\n| `bossroom` | `$0460=12,$0480=32,$0600=84` | 232 / **84** | 0 / 3 | 566 |\n看图定案（`F:/taspipe_scratch/mm_nav/t1/t1_sheet.png`、`t1_zoom_right.png`）：\n- `derived_ctl` 与基线**逐像素相同** ⇒ 写显示副本 = 完全无效，不是\"没测出来\"。\n- `x_only` 相机整屏右滚 40 px ⇒ 写 `$0480`（X hi）**真的把角色搬动了**，游戏从这张表重算显示量。\n- `bossroom` 角色被抬到半空（y=84，画面右上角悬着） ⇒ 写 `$0600`（Y hi）**逐字生效**。\n- `scr12`：写 `$0460=12` 被引擎重算成 **3**，X 同步变 232 ⇒ 屏号是派生量，不能指定房间。","text_sha":"f4189d02b2ecdbf7de8fa94ecaef3015a17fd397","dl":196}],"postings":{"tasvideos":[[0,1],[1,1],[2,1],[3,1],[4,1]],"gameresources":[[0,1],[1,1]],"1":[[0,1],[1,3]],"coordinate":[[0,1]],"system":[[0,1]],"in":[[0,6],[1,1],[3,1],[4,1]],"rockman":[[0,3],[1,7]],"and":[[0,1],[2,2]],"2":[[0,1],[1,2]],"every":[[0,1],[2,1]],"object":[[0,5],[1,1]],"of":[[0,4],[3,1],[4,5]],"the":[[0,14],[1,1],[2,6],[3,3]],"game":[[0,1],[1,1],[2,2],[4,1]],"has":[[0,2],[1,2]],"following":[[0,1]],"properties":[[0,1]],"screen":[[0,6],[1,1]],"number":[[0,1]],"00":[[0,7]],"ff":[[0,7]],"it":[[0,4],[2,3]],"tells":[[0,3]],"which":[[0,1],[3,1],[4,1]],"resides":[[0,1]],"position":[[0,3]],"where":[[0,2],[2,1]],"is":[[0,4],[3,3],[4,1]],"speed":[[0,5]],"80":[[0,2]],"7f":[[0,2]],"8":[[0,1]],"bits":[[0,1]],"decimal":[[0,1]],"part":[[0,2]],"but":[[0,1],[2,2]],"only":[[0,1],[2,1],[4,1]],"integer":[[0,1]],"can":[[0,1],[1,1],[2,1],[4,1]],"be":[[0,1],[1,1],[4,1]],"observed":[[0,1]],"on":[[0,2],[2,1]],"coordinates":[[0,2]],"increase":